SetTeXfrWpxmlPaths=:3 : 0

NB.*SetTeXfrWpxmlPaths v-- sets OS dependent paths.
NB. 
NB. Customize the path and file settings in this verb
NB. to match your locations.
NB.
NB. monad:  SetTeXfrWpxmlPaths uuIgnore

