NB.   0.01 dstat 1{d  
NB.
NB. dyad: it =. pa booksperyear2 btclBtab
NB.
NB.   0 booksperyear2 btab NB. do not merge zero years

1 booksperyear2 y
:
h=. tolower&.> 0{y
d=. }. y
d=. freqlist (h i. <'year') {"1 d
d=. (_1&".&> 0{d) ,: ;1{d

if. x do.
  NB. merge in missing zero years
  d=. d ,. 0 ,:~ (0{d) -.~ ({.0{d) + i. >:(>./ - <./) 0{d
end.
 
(/: 0{d) {"1 d
)

