NB.    NB. puttxt 'daydo.txt'  NB. save ~temp/daydo.txt as daydo_txt
NB.    t=. read jpath '~temp/daydo.txt'
NB.
NB.    (firstdaydomonth daydotabs ]) t  NB. one month
NB.    '' daydotabs t                   NB. all days

NB. (x) is either empty or a month
'invalid month' assert (<x) e. '' ; L3MONTHS

NB. replace checks and blanks with 0s and 1s
t=. allwhitetrim ('/',CKM,'/1 /',DTM,'/0 ') changestr tolower y -. ' ',CR,TAB

NB. split into days, keep days in (x) month, and table
ypfx=. YEARPFX , 2 }. ": 0 { 6!:0 ''
t=. (ypfx E. t) <;.1 t
t=. ];._2@tlf&.> t #~ +./@(x&E.)&> t

b=. ~:({.&.> t) -.&.> ' '
('dates not unique -> ' , ; ,@{.&.> t #~ -. b) assert b

b=. *./@~:&> (2&}."1)@}.&.> t
('day tasks not unique -> ' , ; ,@{.&.> t #~ -. b) assert b

NB. prefix (x) and days in current month/year
t ,~ <,.(x;daysinmonth x),<#t
)

